{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     Find, move to and take object. Check properties and do specific task in order to complete.     list of available nodes: <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectReachable    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectFree    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    />",
